BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:1deb9e13-e69a-49bd-ac6d-8f3dae43c9f8
SUMMARY:Women's History Month: Discussions in STEM
DTSTAMP:20240731T062200Z
DTSTART:20220330T000000Z
DTEND:20220330T013000Z
DESCRIPTION:Come join us at this panel where we celebrate Women’s History M
	onth by discussing what it’s like to be a Woman in STEM. Hear about our ex
	periences with internships\, imposter syndrome\, learning to self-advocate
	\, and breaking down barriers as we navigate professional and educational 
	spaces. We encourage everyone to come be an ally to their peers and collea
	gues by joining us for a learning opportunity in a welcoming environment. 
	RSVP at https://tinyurl.com/panelutd
END:VEVENT
